Package: whereipm
Title: Integral Projection Model to study spatial ecology of a population
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Seba", "De Bona", email = "sebastiano.debona@gmail.com", 
                 role = c('aut','cre'))
                 )
Description: This package parameterises spatial Integral Projection Models where the state 
             variable is position in space along one dimension.
             Vital rates of IPM here correspond to survival(S), reproduction(R), 
             adult dispersal(G) and natal dispersal(I).
             The model can include density-dependent vital rates, gradients across space
             (i.e. latitudinal/altitudinal) etc. 
License: MIT license
URL: https://gitlab.com/sebadebona/dispersal-ipm
